<p>Week ago (est)			110,000	6,000     321,000</p>
<p>Year ago (act)			134,000	5,000     362,000</p>
<p>Previous Day Estimated	Steer &amp; Heifer	   Cow &amp; Bull</p>
<p>Friday			     100,000		     31,000</p>
