<p>***Revisions:  Friday Cattle Slaughter 131,000; Friday Hog Slaughter 317,000; Saturday Cattle Slaughter 35,000 and WTD 672,000; and Saturday Hog Slaughter 53,000 and WTD 1,767,000</p>
